H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Pekoms - Infobox,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Map,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:55.30,Title,,0,0,260,,Gear SecondDialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:01.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear? Are your techniques going to evolve?Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you giving off steam...Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:07.05,Main,,0,0,0,,to pretend that you're a steam engine?Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:09.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of a bluff is that?Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:16.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I met you guys here.Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:28.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Now I won't have to lose any of my crew.Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:46.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to aim? That'll only give me a chance to dodge.Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:50.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Try and hit me if you can.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:51.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:05.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Rifle!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's so fast!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:22.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Stamp!Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Spear!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:29.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Missile!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:40.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No way...!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No, there's no mistaking it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:51.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that I met you guys here.Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:58.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This boy has mastered Shave, one of the Six Powers!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:01.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Air Door!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:14.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:21.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's strong enough to not just use it, but use it freely.Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:27.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But... there's no way someone could be faster than a Six Powers master!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:29.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A Six Powers master can't lose!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:37.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is make him into a door to restrain his movements.Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:40.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll go all-in and settle this in an instant.  Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.15,Main,,0,0,0,,He disappeared...Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:45.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Door-Door!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw how you guys move when you vanish.Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You kick the ground dozens of times a second.Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:00.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I got the hang of it, too.Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:04.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I needed to know how to do that.Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:12.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll take it... with the strongest Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body: Strength!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Jet Bazooka!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are tough.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,, All right, I'll show ya something even better.Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:44.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Check this out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear...Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Whew, my body still can't keep up.Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:12.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care about that right now.Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:17.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I got set back quite a bit.Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:17.10,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:17.11,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:17.13,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:17.15,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:17.16,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:17.18,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:17.20,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:17.21,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:17.23,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:17.25,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:17.26,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:17.28,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:17.30,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:17.31,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:17.33,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:17.35,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:17.36,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:17.38,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:17.40,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:17.41,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:17.43,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:17.45,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:17.48,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:17.50,Note,,0,0,0,,Gates of Ju