,0,0,0,,Dammit! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:29.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Cannons! Fire the cannons! We'll be crushed!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:34.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's useless! I'm not gonna stop, you midgets!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:38.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, neither! You can't stop Oimo!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Really, I can't believe it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:46.74,Main,,0,0,0,,To think these knotty gatekeepers are on our side now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:50.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to the bond between warriors!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:54.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, my brothers! The courthouse is very close now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:56.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Move forward!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:56.32,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:56.34,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:56.35,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:56.37,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:56.39,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:56.40,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:56.42,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:56.44,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:56.45,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:56.47,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.47,0:06:56.49,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:56.50,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:56.52,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:56.54,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:56.55,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:56.57,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:56.59,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.59,0:06:56.60,Note,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:56.62,Note