0,,Upper Floors of the CourtroomDialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:19.65,Note,,0,0,0,,Upper Floors of the CourtroomDialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:19.67,Note,,0,0,0,,Upper Floors of the CourtroomDialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:19.69,Note,,0,0,0,,Upper Floors of the CourtroomDialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:19.70,Note,,0,0,0,,Upper Floors of the CourtroomDialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:19.72,Note,,0,0,0,,Upper Floors of the CourtroomDialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:20.65,Note,,0,0,0,,Upper Floors of the CourtroomDialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,After them! Bring down the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Those damn guards! I didn't realize that there were still a bunch inside!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.52,Main,,0,0,0,,There they are! Take them down!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:33.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta our way!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't throw them my way, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Guilty! Guilty! Guilty! Guilty! Guilty...Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, where the hell am I?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:50.43,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:50.45,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:50.47,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:50.50,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:50.52,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:50.53,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:50.55,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:50.57,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:50.58,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:50.60,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:50.62,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:50.65,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:50.67,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:50.7