:51.28,0:08:51.30,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:51.32,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:51.33,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:51.37,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:51.39,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:51.40,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:51.42,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:51.44,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:51.45,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:51.49,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:51.50,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:51.59,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:52.54,Note,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:01.86,Main,,0,0,0,,We're taking Franky and Nico Robin to the Gates of Justice already?Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Just do as I said!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:07.45,Main,,0,0,0,,But the escort ship departing from the Gates of Justice isn't ready!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:11.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's fine! We can just wait on the other side of the gates!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The point is we have to first deprive the pirates of their objective.Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Once we're through the Gates of Justice...Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.05,Main,,0,0,0,,they won't be able to interfere anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:24.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, gather all the members of CP9!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Right… stand up, you two!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:35.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Your journey to hell starts now.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,After that, we can take our time and drive the pirates into a corner.Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything these guys do is something else.Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:50.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone with some sense would never meddle with this island.Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see, Chimney.Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:56.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether they live or die...Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:10:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,, the world will stand in awe at this incident.Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:04.76,Main,,0,0,0,,No one has been able to do this for the past several hundred years.Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,After this battle...Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:12.85,Main,,0,0,0,,that straw hat kid will be notorious worldwide!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:27.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's here!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:35.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We've come to get you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:40.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief! A guy in a straw hat is shouting something on the courthouse rooftop!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I think it's Straw Hat Luffy, the captain of the Straw Hat Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:49.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! When I checked earlier, Blueno was on the rooftop!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he standing watch?! That idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:54.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he doing at a critical time like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:03.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I did quite a bit of fighting, so...Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:05.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starving!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:09.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect time for...Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.88,Main,,0,0,0,,lunch!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that I had these in my pockets!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:21.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Mmm... so good.Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:31.24,Main,,0,0,0,,So he's the one? Straw Hat Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What's Blueno doin-Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... He couldn't have...Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a member of CP9.Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a Six Powers master with Devil Fruit powers.Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Blueno, a superhuman with a Power Level of over 800...Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.82,0:11:55.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! I'm back to 100%!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:59.09,Main,,0,0,0,,was taken out by a brat like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chief! What should we do?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:10.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucci... where's Lucci?Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Call in Lucci and the others! Gather everyone here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll order CP9 to annihilate Straw Hat Luffy and his crew!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:22.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir! Right away!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:24.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell the Baskervilles, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:27.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell them that if the pirates somehow lower the drawbridge...Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll cut off all of their heads!Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:30.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:37.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:42.81,Main,,0,0,0,,They finally made it this far.Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is really crazy.Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I get that you accepted...Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:52.16,Main,,0,0,0,,the government's terms of surrender to save your friends.Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But you just saw that moronic chief casually break your agreement.Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,, Meekly giving in to your surrender ain't gonna save nobody.Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:08.74,Main,,0,0,0,, At this point, your only option is letting them help you to escape.Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:13.20,Main,,0,0,0,,And yet, you're looking so down...Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,as if you're still running away from something.Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid your friends will die here or something?Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.29,0:13:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,If you turn your back on them, they can't save you.  Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:29.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is anyone there?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:37.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll help you see Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry and get Nico Robin away from Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:47.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Get ready to depart for the Gates of Justice immediately!  Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring those two!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:50.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Just do it! Now!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:55.12,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:58.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky's butt is inflating!Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:14:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! What the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:03.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Spanda!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:08.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I realized that this is the end of the line for me, so I've chosen to self-destruct.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.19,0:14:09.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,At least I'll get to take some of you vile scum with me.Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Wait, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,My life will end with a three-kilometer wide explosion. Don't try to stop me.Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it! Help! Don't take me with you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:29.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Three... Two...Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:31.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I can't die here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,One...Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.26,0:14:39.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:45.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Coup de Boo!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:53.68,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! It broke the chains, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! I'm falling!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:14:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:16.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Good thing there was a fence.Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:20.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you aren't hurt, right?Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:26.12,Main,,0,0,0,,If I had another bottle of cola,Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:30.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I could've also taken us to the other side using Coup de Vent...Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Straw Hat's there.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:36.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, respond to him.Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! He tricked us!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:42.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief! Franky and Nico Robin broke their chains and made it to the balcony!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You fools! What're you doing?! Capture them already!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,If you let them get away, I'll have you all hanged!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:49.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:16:03.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Robin! What a relief! You're still here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:08.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Capture them again! Don't let them get away, no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:10.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta my way, small fries!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:12.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:17.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like Franky's there, too.Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:20.40,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Just wait right there.Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.90,Main,,0,0,0,,It's far, but I'll try to fly over!Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:44.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I've told you so many times already!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:56.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't return to you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:17:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Go back! I don't want to see your faces again!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:03.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you come to rescue me?Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:06.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why did you come to rescue me?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:09.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This isn't what I want.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,When did I ask you to do any of this?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want to... die!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:33.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hilarious! What the heck are they doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:37.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:40.95,Main,,0,0,0,,They risked their lives to come all the way here! And you...Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:42.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They did it on their own.Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Don't be ridic–Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You're in my way.Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaku! Was that in retaliation?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:57.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You know, for getting that weird fruit?Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:01.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold your tongue! I like my fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:08.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Is it just Straw Hat that's our enemy?Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:11.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi! Even if he's alone,Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,it is admirable that he made it this far.Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.15,0:18:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Blueno is down.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What a fool!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess being a bar owner for five years would make one weaker, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,He got so weak that he lost?Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:35.14,Main,,0,0,0,,He's been defeated. Chapapa.Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:40.40,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm glad that you're here, CP9!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:45.86,Main,,0,0,0,,But wait a little longer. The Straw Hats have just started imploding!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How could we not watch this?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's freakin' hilarious!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:19:00.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit, ribbit, ribbit, ribbit...!Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit...Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job, Yokozuna! Keep it up!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:08.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit.Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Guilty!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:22.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's the Guilty Jurors!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Step aside. We'll pass down the verdict for that frog's crime.Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:28.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.59,0:19:35.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Guilty!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Guilty!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously! What the heck are these guys?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:56.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Guilty! Guilty!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:58.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, go, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Just me?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I never imagined this island...Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:09.01,Main,,0,0,0,,even had a chief justice.Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:14.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought everyone taken to Enies Lobby was already considered guilty.Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:18.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd heard they just came here to pass through an empty courthouse.  Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:21.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's wrong, pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:25.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the most authoritative, fair court in the world.Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.48,Main,,0,0,0,,We conduct fair trials!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,However...!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:33.97,Main,,0,0,0,,the jurors who issue verdicts of guilty or not guilty...Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,are former pirates who're on death row...Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and wish to take you down with them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:47.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Judged by death-row convicts?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:49.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hence, in this town, no one...Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:50.82,Main,,0,0,0,,in history...Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:54.31,Main,,0,0,0,,has been found not guilty!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.31,0:20:55.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Kiwi!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:00.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys!Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:05.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Guilty!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.60,0:21:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! They're...Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.61,0:21:13.36,Main,,0,0,0,,If we don't get through here, we can't bring down the drawbridge!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:16.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We left Big Bro's rescue to Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:20.55,Main,,0,0,0,,If we get stuck here, they can't move forward!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:25.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.81,0:21:31.81,Main,,0,0,0,,To think you took so many big iron balls to the face…!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:34.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't bother! We've still got more than 6000 soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:41.24,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone into the courthouse!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Crush the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:50.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit...!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:03.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on? Why are the Giants...Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Frog!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:09.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Tell me what's going on!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.27,0:22:12.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah... You're with Straw Hat-san.Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:19.43,Main,,0,0,0,,To think that he's been holding back this many guards...Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.43,0:22:22.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That frog is something else!Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are they? They got lost again. We don't have time for this.Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.07,0:22:40.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh, yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.89,0:22:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Basically, so long as I get to the upper floors, it doesn't matter how, right?Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:49.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.11,0:22:58.90,Main,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here, too!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:14.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys really are incredible!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You even subdued the Giants. You are a dangerous man!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.76,0:23:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Er... Well...Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.57,0:23:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. All of your friends headed to the rooftop.Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.06,0:23:25.90,Main,,0,0,0,,The rooftop?Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:27.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You should hurry there, too!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.49,0:23:31.48,Main,,0,0,0,,King of snipers. Leave it to me.Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.48,0:23:32.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:39.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna die?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:41.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief. If we go over there quickly and eliminate that guy,Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.41,0:23:51.34,Main,,0,0,0,,wouldn't that end this whole thing?Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:56.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait. The captain comes all this way to rescue his crewmate...Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:24:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,just to have her ultimately refuse his help.Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.86,0:24:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you guys ever seen anything so hilarious?Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:09.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna die?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.60,0:24:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen to his pathetic shout! I can only imagine the look on his...Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.65,0:24:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you talking about?Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.70,0:24:21.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:23.53,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He's picking his nose!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.45,0:24:27.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:30.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We've already come this far.Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.39,0:24:43.26,Main,,0,0,0,,So, we're gonna rescue you anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.26,0:24:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Nailed it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.57,0:24:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,If you still wanna die after that,Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.61,0:24:53.24,Main,,0,0,0,,you can die then.Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.07,0:24:58.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.72,0:25:00.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Chopper?Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.82,0:25:02.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm all right.Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:05.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But what just happened?Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.47,0:25:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I have some idea.Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:20.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I should've come up here like this from the start.Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:23.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro! So it really was you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.09,0:25:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We were okay because we weren't in the middle of it...Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:28.26,Main,,0,0,0,,but if we had been, we would've died!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.26,0:25:30.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What happened to you guys?Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.85,0:25:32.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Hiyaa!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.37,0:25:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Dash! Boar Stew Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.99,0:25:40.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the first to arrive, without a doubt.Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I've kept Robin-chan waiting. I'm coming to rescue...Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.78,0:25:45.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Moss!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:48.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Moss Head! How come you got here before me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:51.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? What took you so long? Did you get lost?Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.44,0:25:57.18,Main,,0,0,0,,H-H-Hey, where'd you learn that phrase?Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.90,0:25:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh...!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.82,0:26:02.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.69,0:26:09.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! He's flying!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.68,0:26:11.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.62,0:26:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's he been all this time?Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.85,0:26:21.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he... gonna land okay?Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.77,0:26:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa… one after another…Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.33,0:26:31.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi! In any case...Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.72,0:26:34.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,to think that they've marched into headquarters...Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.98,0:26:41.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though they're our enemy, that's admirable!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.90,0:26:47.31,Main,,0,0,0,,A-A-A bunch of pirates have made it this far!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:10.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.40,0:27:14.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You can go ahead and say you wanna die or whatever,Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.35,0:27:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,but say those things... by our side!Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.91,0:27:21.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right, Robin-chwan!Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.64,0:27:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin! Come back!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:47.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sogeking. Can you stand up?Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.38,0:27:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm...?Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.10,0:27:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Naturally. ‘Tis but a scratch!Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.92,0:28:02.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm all right.Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Just leave the rest to us!Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:50.57,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking: Halee  Title: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13